# CODEOWNERS
#
# Controls which team must approve changes to each part of the codebase.
# GitHub requires at least one approving review from a listed owner before
# a PR can be merged (once branch protection is enabled).
#
# Last matching rule wins.
#
# ── Teams that must exist in the khayyam-math GitHub org ─────────────────────
#
#   @khayyam-math/core
#       The maintainer(s). Full review rights everywhere.
#       Add members at: github.com/orgs/khayyam-math/teams/core
#
#   @khayyam-math/trusted-contributors
#       Contributors who have had ≥2 templates merged. Can review template
#       PRs without a core maintainer, but cannot approve Tier A changes.
#       Add members at: github.com/orgs/khayyam-math/teams/trusted-contributors
#
# ── Trust tiers ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
#   Tier A  core only      Security-critical files, infra, the routing pipeline,
#                          dependencies, and all governance files. Any change
#                          requires a review from @khayyam-math/core.
#
#   Tier B  core + trusted Individual template modules under studio/templates/.
#                          A @khayyam-math/trusted-contributors member can
#                          review and approve. Core can always step in.
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────


# ── Tier A default ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Everything not matched by a more specific rule below requires core review.
*                                               @khayyam-math/core


# ── Tier B: individual template modules ──────────────────────────────────────
# Pure-Python functions that render one math-operation family deterministically.
# Trusted contributors can review new templates and template bugfixes here.
/studio/templates/                              @khayyam-math/core @khayyam-math/trusted-contributors


# ── Tier A overrides within the templates directory ───────────────────────────
# These files control how ALL templates are registered and classified.
# A change here affects every template, not just one — core review required.
/studio/templates/router.py                     @khayyam-math/core
/studio/templates/__init__.py                   @khayyam-math/core
